#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:248
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tuist cuts our build times by 65% and reduces project conflicts, letting us focus on developer experience and testing. Hundreds of devs across multiple organizations, alongside AI agents, collaborate on Trendyol. Tuist is key to running tens of thousands of UI and unit tests across thousands of pipelines every day."
msgstr "Tuist 將我們的建置時間縮短了 65%，並減少專案衝突，讓我們能專注於開發者體驗與測試。Trendyol 有數百名來自多個組織的開發者，以及 AI 代理程式共同協作。Tuist 是每天在數千條管線中執行數萬次 UI 與單元測試的關鍵。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:218
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tuist has made a meaningful difference to developer productivity across our growing iOS engineering organization which means faster iteration for both our engineers and coding agents working alongside them. Tuist has helped us turn build performance into a scalable advantage"
msgstr "Tuist 為我們不斷成長的 iOS 工程團隊帶來顯著的生產力提升，讓工程師與協作的編碼代理程式都能更快迭代。Tuist 幫助我們將建置效能轉化為可擴展的優勢"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:233
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tuist has made a real difference in how we work with Fetch's large, highly modular iOS codebase. Its remote module cache has materially reduced build times and tightened feedback loops for engineers locally and in CI, while Build Insights gives us valuable visibility into build performance and where to focus next. That combination of speed and observability has made the developer experience meaningfully better."
msgstr "Tuist 對我們處理 Fetch 龐大且高度模組化的 iOS 程式碼庫帶來了實質改變。其遠端模組快取大幅縮短了建置時間，並緊縮了工程師在本地與 CI 中的回饋循環；而 Build Insights 則讓我們清楚掌握建置效能，並指引下一步的優化重點。這種速度與可觀測性的結合，顯著提升了開發體驗。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/home.html.heex:814
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tuist is built in the open because we believe developer infrastructure should be transparent, extensible, and community-driven."
msgstr "Tuist 採用開放模式開發，因為我們相信開發者基礎設施應當透明、可擴充，並由社群驅動。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/home.html.heex:630
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tuist is trusted by over 300+ product teams, from fast-growing startups to global enterprises."
msgstr "全球超過 300 支產品團隊信賴 Tuist，涵蓋從快速成長的新創公司到跨國企業。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:293
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tuist made git worktrees practical on our huge codebase. Worktrees used to be painful here — every new one ate serious disk space, opening the project over and over had real overhead, and each fresh worktree meant another clean build. Tuist shrank all of those hurdles, so now I spin up worktrees without hesitation — which is exactly what AI-assisted development needs."
msgstr "Tuist 讓 git worktrees 在我們龐大的程式碼庫中變得實用。過去使用 worktrees 相當痛苦——每個新的 worktree 都會佔用大量磁碟空間，反覆開啟專案帶來明顯額外負擔，且每個全新的 worktree 都意味著必須重新進行完整建置。Tuist 消除了這些障礙，現在我可以毫不猶豫地啟動 worktrees，這正是 AI 輔助開發所需要的。"

