#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/home.html.heex:627
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Powering teams that move fast"
msgstr "為快速發展的團隊提供動力"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:113
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Delivery Hero scaled its iOS rider app to around 115 modules with Tuist, cutting clean builds from 2.5 to 0.5 minutes and CI build and test time by 2.5x. Its Logistics team uses Tuist to keep modularization manageable and local builds fast."
msgstr "Delivery Hero 使用 Tuist 將其 iOS 騎士應用程式擴展至約 115 個模組，將完整建置時間從 2.5 分鐘縮短至 0.5 分鐘，並將 CI 建置和測試時間減少 2.5 倍。其物流團隊使用 Tuist 確保模組化易於管理，並保持本機建置速度。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:93
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Monzo reduced its pull request CI times by 71%, from 52 minutes to just 15 minutes, using Tuist's binary caching and selective testing. By eliminating redundant builds and running only relevant tests, Monzo improved development efficiency for its 45+ iOS engineers working across nearly 200 modules."
msgstr "Monzo 使用 Tuist 的二進位快取和選擇性測試，將其拉取請求的 CI 時間減少了 71%，從 52 分鐘縮短至僅 15 分鐘。透過消除冗餘建置並僅執行相關測試，Monzo 提升了其 45 多位 iOS 工程師在近 200 個模組上工作的開發效率。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/home.html.heex:703
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Read more"
msgstr "閱讀更多"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:98
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Toss, Korea's leading financial super-app, more than tripled the share of local builds that finish within a minute using Tuist's binary cache. Across close to 1,000 modules, product developers now build only the modules they own, with most of the graph served from cache."
msgstr "韓國領先的金融超級應用程式 Toss，使用 Tuist 的二進位快取，將一分鐘內完成的本機建置比例提高了兩倍以上。在近 1,000 個模組中，產品開發人員現在只需建置他們擁有的模組，大部分圖譜皆由快取提供。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:103
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Trendyol reduced build times by 65% with Tuist's caching, cutting CI builds to 10 minutes and local UI test setup to 30 seconds. Running a self-hosted Tuist instance, it keeps feedback loops fast for 170+ developers across more than 10 domain teams."
msgstr "Trendyol 透過 Tuist 的快取功能將建置時間減少了 65%，將 CI 建置縮短至 10 分鐘，並將本機 UI 測試設定縮短至 30 秒。透過運行自託管的 Tuist 實例，它為跨越 10 多個領域團隊的 170 多位開發人員保持了快速的回饋循環。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_controller.ex:108
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "monday.com's CI merge workflow dropped from more than 20 minutes to about 9, with Tuist's module cache playing a significant role. Its team of almost 20 iOS engineers now maintains around 200 modules, and creating a new one is simple enough for anyone on the team."
msgstr "monday.com 的 CI 合併工作流程從超過 20 分鐘縮短至約 9 分鐘，Tuist 的模組快取在其中發揮了重要作用。其近 20 人的 iOS 工程師團隊現在維護著約 200 個模組，且建立新模組的流程簡單到團隊任何成員都能輕鬆上手。"

