#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/pricing.html.heex:575
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run macOS and Linux CI jobs next to your cache, on any plan. You pay per minute of job time with no rounding up to whole minutes, and machine boot and cleanup are on us."
msgstr "在任何方案中，都能讓 macOS 和 Linux CI 工作與你的快取並行執行。依工作實際執行分鐘數計費，不向上取整至整分鐘，機器啟動與清理時間由我們承擔。"

